<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine 91-day T-bill rate falls to 11.528 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine 91-day T-bill rate falls to 11.528 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' benchmark 91-day Treasury bill rate dropped to an average of 11.528 percent at Monday's regular auction from last week's 11.531 percent, the Bureau of Treasury said.</p>
</text>
